# Flagged RA and TA Applications Report

## Author: Joy Okafor

## Context
This spreadsheet lists applications for Research Assistant (RA) and Teaching Assistant (TA) positions that have been flagged due to inconsistencies in academic transcripts. The flagged applications require further review and follow-ups with the respective applicants to resolve the discrepancies.

